Retain the approved copied-Root attempt and the first physical-capacity refusal.
The verifier is data-only: it never imports archived Python, starts Cargo, uses
Git, contacts a registry or executes a restored source. Exact dependency archive
checksums are retained; ordinary Cargo archives and compiler caches are excluded.
The complete frozen Root source tar is retained as deterministic gzip data.
Restoration writes source and locks into a new contained target directory only.
Copied-Root success is never product Root adoption or release/server admission.
